{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2014/10/13/IMG_5709.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんたーん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3連休の中日だから皆さん充実した"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日々を送っているかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなあたし達もめちゃめちゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"充実した日々を送ってますよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のアンダーライブも2公演♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2回連続で見てたよ૧(●´৺`●)૭って方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしかしていたりしそうだよね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも今回夜公演で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MCの時にまいちゅんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「2回目きたよー！って方いますか？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って質問してみたら、たくさんの方が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「はーーーーい♥︎♥︎♥︎」って。笑い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん、なかなかもってますね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、それと同じくらいに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「はじめて来たよ！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って方も居たのでそういう方は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりじっくり推しを見て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"癒されたりな1日だったんですね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ...(´°ω°`)でも、たまにはで良いから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんを見てねーー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたしダンス特徴的だとよく言われるからきっとライブとかで遠くてもすぐ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見つけられると思うので。笑い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目があったらずっと見つめてやる♥︎♥︎♥︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで、明日は片っ端から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんと目合わせにいっちゃうぞ\\( ˆωˆ )/笑い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でね、昨日の話なんだけどモンハン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"買いに行くって意気込んでたけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさかお店に行ってみたらなんと⁈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「売り切れ」(´°ω°`)号泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"必死の思いで「あの、入荷待ちとか...」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と聞いてみると食い気味で「あ、そういうのやってないんですよね\\( ˆωˆ )/」と言われた...泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うぅ、店員さん...泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと、何人もの方に聞かれていたんでしょうね。だから察してあたしが聞いたときにかなり食い気味だったんでしょうね。あたしかなり傷ついたよ、店員さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という、悲しい思いをして落ち込んでます。かなり落ち込んでます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なのでネットで頼みました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日曜日だからネットのお店も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"定休日が多いんでしょうね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お店からの返信が返ってこないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落ち込みました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて？モンハンはいつ届くのでしょうか？お預け期間とかいらないから早く届いてほしいのーーー？(´°ω°`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お店からの連絡まだかな...."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むっ(´°ω°`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"b